SproutTower_Interior1_Text_Woman2::
	.string "See the pillar shaking?\p"
	.string "People are training upstairs.$"

SproutTower_Interior1_Text_OldMan2::
	.string "SPROUT TOWER was built long ago\n"
	.string "as a place for POKéMON training.$"

SproutTower_Interior1_Text_OldMan1::
	.string "Only if you reach the top will you\n"
	.string "obtain an HM.$"

SproutTower_Interior1_Text_OldWoman::
	.string "A BELLSPROUT over 100 feet tall...\n"
	.string "People say that it became the center\l"
	.string "pillar here.$"

SproutTower_Interior1_Text_SageChowIntro::
	.string "We stand guard in this tower.\p"
	.string "Here, we express our gratitude to\n"
	.string "honor all POKéMON.$"

SproutTower_Interior1_Text_SageChowDefeat::
	.string "Th-Thank you!$"

SproutTower_Interior1_Text_SageChow::
	.string "All living beings coexist through\n"
	.string "cooperation.\p"
	.string "We must always be thankful for this.$"
